# Google Play — release notes (max 500 chars per locale)
# Paste into Play Console → Release → Release notes
# Version 1.0.6 (versionCode 7) — update, not a first release

<en-US>
• Precious metals now work offline: the last price is kept, with its source and update time
• Enter metal amounts in ounces or grams
• Comparison chart fixed: both pairs share one scale and show % change
• The "1 day" range now really shows 1 day
• Rate alerts stay on when a notification cannot be delivered
• The widget can now be emptied of all currencies
• Fixed a crash on Android 6 in Settings and Rates
• More reliable rate cache
</en-US>

